  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "纖維及高分子化學",
    "sub_ename": "FIBER AND POLYMER CHEMISTRY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在使學生充分掌握高分子和纖維的分子結構，並深入了解高分子化學聚合反應的機制。其中包括逐步聚合反應和自由基聚合反應等基本概念。此外，課程還會詳細介紹高分子分子量的測定方法及其分子量分佈，讓學生能夠全面了解這些技術和方法的應用。通過這些學習，學生將能夠理解高分子聚合反應在製造纖維及複合材料中的重要性和實際應用。課程目標是培養學生具備分析和解決問題的能力，並能夠將所學知識應用於實際生產和研發過程中，從而為未來在纖維與高分子材料科學和工程領域的職業發展打下堅實的基礎。通過本課程，學生將具備更強的專業知識，能夠在未來的工作中更加靈活和創新地應對各種挑戰。",
    "describe_eh": "This course provides a comprehensive understanding of the molecular structures of polymers and fibers and detailed knowledge of polymerization mechanisms, including step-growth and free-radical polymerization. It covers methods for determining polymer molecular weight and distribution, ensuring students grasp these techniques' applications. Students will learn the significance of polymerization reactions in manufacturing fibers and composite materials. The course develops analytical and problem-solving skills, enabling students to apply their knowledge to real-world production and R&D processes. It lays a solid foundation for careers in fiber and polymer material science and engineering, preparing students to tackle future challenges creatively and flexibly.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "旨在了解各種天然纖維與高分子之分子結構等。",
      "describe_en": "Intended to comprehend the molecular structures of different fibers and polymers"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "旨在了解各種高分子之反應機構，分子量變化，分子量控制，以及分子量分佈等。",
      "describe_en": "Focused on understanding polymer reaction mechanisms, molecular weight changes, control, and distribution across various polymers."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "旨在了解如何應用各種高分子之反應機構與製程，歸納比較高分子聚合製程之條件。",
      "describe_en": "Focused on understanding diverse polymer reaction mechanisms and processes, summarizing, and comparing polymerization process conditions."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "旨在了解各種實用聚合方法應用於纖維與複合材料之應用上，使理論和實際運用相互結合，且能夠描述其原理及其在工業上的應用範圍。",
      "describe_en": "Focused on understanding the application of diverse polymerization methods in fibers and composites, merging theory with practice, and explaining their principles and industrial uses."
    }
  ],
